(3) 145th Report on action taken by the Government on the recommendations/observations of the Committee contained in its one hundred and thirty-sixth report on Demands for Grants (2008-09) of the Ministry of Tourism; 

(4) 146th Report on action taken by the Government on the recommendations/observations of the Committee contained in its one hundred and thirty-seventh report on Demands for Grants (2008-09) of the Ministry of Culture; and 

